    "description": "Food and Drug Administration regulations under 21 CFR. Covers food safety (HACCP, FSMA), medical device classification (Class I/II/III), drug manufacturing (cGMP), labeling requirements, biocompatibility testing, and temperature controls for food storage and transport."
